msgid "Your nickname has been upgraded! You can check it out from the menu."
msgstr "Il tuo soprannome è salito di livello! Puoi controllarlo dal menu."

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Welcome to the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Is this your first time here? You'll have to register before you can fight. "
"Take a look at the rules while you wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Your registration is complete."
msgstr "Registrazione completata."

msgctxt "940"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Cosa vuoi fare?"

msgctxt "952"
msgid "What else can we do for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"Please be forewarned that you will not be able to use any weapons or "
"defensive gear."
msgstr "Attenzione: non potrai usare armi o equipaggiamento difensivo."

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Please select a tournament."
msgstr "Seleziona un torneo."

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Thank you, and good luck."
msgstr "Grazie e buona fortuna."

